 help you and there is  nothing i want more  than for more players to play elden ring  i want them to have as good of an  experience as i'm currently having but  it definitely definitely  doesn't have to be in the exact same way  i'm doing it but if you can just go off  and look at this world from a different  perspective look at all the love and  care that is put into this game that we  just don't see very much in most games  that release nowadays and i believe you  will have that good experience and  appreciation for what we have been given  with elden ring it's not perfect because  nothing can be perfect but there is love  attention and care to every single thing  and i promise you that the developers  did not want to discourage anybody from  playing their game that just wouldn't be  smart for them in general you can beat  eldon ring  absolutely  if you have any questions or need help  with anything with elden ring leave a  comment or check out my twitch channel  where i'll be streaming the game every  single day thanks for watching the video  leave a like and subscribe if you feel  like it see you in the next video gamers
 

